   "id": "papers-history",
   "area": "Paperwork",
   "check": "Service invoices",
   "how": "Ask for bills, not just stamps. Look for tensioners, pump, thermostat and gearbox fluid.",
   "bad": "Gaps, or stamps with no invoices. An owner quoted by PistonHeads says walk away.",
   "cost": null,
