   "id": "eng-tensioners",
   "area": "Engine",
   "check": "Upper tensioners",
   "how": "Not on a viewing: no seller lets you take the cam covers off. Ask for invoices that name the parts, and listen on a cold start instead. If you buy the car, look under the covers when you next do the plugs or gaskets.",
